# Accessor properties across SEPARATE packages. `@test/geo` exports a class with
# a get/set accessor; the root app imports it and reads/writes the accessor both
# on the class type and through an interface the class implements — exercising the
# imported-class reconstruction of the synthetic getter/setter vtable methods.
# name         dir   deps         root
@test/geo      geo   -
main           app   @test/geo    root
